  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 7008.02 Quorum",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 7008.02 Quorum. A quorum of the commission shall consist of not less than 9 members and a majority vote by the members present shall be necessary to pass a motion unless otherwise specified by law. In the absence of the chair or vice-chair, a quorum of the commission shall designate a pro tempore officer for the officer or officers absent.\n\nSource. #9091, eff 2-21-08 (See Revision Note at Chapter Heading for Saf-C 7000); ss by #11128, eff 6-29-16 (formerly Saf-C 7009.02)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c7000.html"
